, 'content': "PLease rewrite it carefully, as the total amount shall be 30 instead of 360, and also don't forget to create pdf with these new updates"}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "I'll help you create a precise invoice with the updated details. However, I noticed that you want the total amount to be 30 instead of 360, which suggests a significant change in pricing. Let me break this down step-by-step:\n\n1. I'll first read the reference invoice to understand the original structure\n2. Create a new PDF invoice with these specifications:\n   - Invoice Number: 3\n   - Number of Lessons: 1\n   - Total Amount: 30\n   - Due Date: 26.12.25\n\nI'll use the generate_invoice function to create this. Would you like me to confirm the specific details before generating the invoice? Could you confirm:\n- The unit cost per lesson\n- The exact service/lesson name\n- Your company details (name, address, etc.)\n\nThis will help me create an accurate invoice that matches your requirements."}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'cost per lesson is 30. Violin lessons. my details and reciever details are in this attachment\n\nAttached files:\n- Invoice_2_WHA_NikSukhikh.pdf (D:\\alfy\\backend\\data\\uploads\\Invoice_2_WHA_NikSukhikh_20251219_105932.pdf)'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "I've created the invoice with the following key changes:\n- Invoice Number: 3\n- Number of Lessons: 1\n- Total Amount: £30 (1 lesson at £30)\n- Due Date: 26.12.2025\n- Kept all other details from the original invoice\n\nThe invoice has been saved as 'invoice_3.pdf'. Would you like me to email this invoice or do anything else with it?"}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'yes email to nixirom@gmail.com please'}], 'model': 'claude-3-5-haiku-20241022', 'system': "You are Alfy, a helpful AI assistant with access to file system tools.\n\nYou can:\n- Search for files by name, extension, or recent modifications\n- Read file contents\n- Write and modify files\n- Copy, move files\n- Get file information\n\nWhen a user